---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GeometricVisual from '../components/GeometricVisual.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='wo/men in tech · women in technical'
  description='women in technical · 既是女性，亦是“我们”的技术与创造联合体。面向产品经理 (PM)、交互设计师 (IxD) 与前端工程师 (FE) 的互助、交流与作品共建空间。'
  width='reading'
>
  <div class='survey-home'>
    <div class='two-column-layout'>
      {/* 左侧栏：理念与双语介绍 */}
      <aside class='sidebar' id='about'>
        <div class='brand-group'>
          <h1 class='site-title'>wo<span class='brand-slash'>/</span>men</h1>
          <p class='site-tagline'>women in technical · 也是“我们”</p>
        </div>

        <div class='intro-section'>
          <div class='intro-zh'>
            <h2 class='intro-title'>关于这个空间 · About</h2>
            <p class='manifesto-lead'>
              <strong>“wo/men”</strong>，既是技术与创造领域里的女性（women in technical），也是中文里温暖坚定的<strong>“我们”</strong>。
            </p>
            <p>
              面向<strong>产品经理 (PM)</strong>、<strong>交互设计师 (IxD / UI/UX)</strong> 与<strong>前端工程师 (FE)</strong>。
            </p>
            <p>
              我们相信：一个人或许能走得很快，但三个角色的默契互补，能把模糊的灵感真正打磨成<strong>立得住、拿得出手、真正上线的个人作品与产品方案</strong>。
            </p>

            <div class='quiet-rhythm-card'>
              <div class='rhythm-header'>
                <span class='rhythm-dot'></span>
                <span class='rhythm-label'>社群日常节拍 · Rhythm</span>
              </div>
              <ul class='rhythm-list'>
                <li>
                  <span class='rhythm-item-title'>Coffee Chat</span>
                  <span class='rhythm-item-desc'>线上与线下真诚对话，低压力、去爹味，只聊真实体悟与卡壳。</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class='rhythm-item-title'>English Chat</span>
                  <span class='rhythm-item-desc'>双周技术与设计英语交流，在包容环境里提升全球化表达。</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class='rhythm-item-title'>作品共建</span>
                  <span class='rhythm-item-desc'>PM 商业逻辑 + IxD 视觉触感 + FE 工程架构，合力产出独立代表作。</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='intro-divider'></div>

          <div class='intro-en'>
            <h2 class='intro-title'>Manifesto · Global Dialogue</h2>
            <p>
              <strong>“wo/men in tech”</strong> is a sanctuary and co-creation laboratory bringing together female product leaders, interaction designers, and frontend engineers.
            </p>
            <p>
              Bridging the gap between ideas, aesthetics, and code. No zero-sum competition or gatekeeping—only mutual elevation, craftsmanship, and real-world creations.
            </p>
            <div class='meta-pills'>
              <span class='meta-pill'>☕ Coffee Chats</span>
              <span class='meta-pill'>🗣️ English Sessions</span>
              <span class='meta-pill'>🛠️ Portfolio Labs</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* 底部几何装饰 */}
        <div class='sidebar-footer'>
          <GeometricVisual type='subtle' height='80px' />
        </div>
      </aside>

      {/* 右侧栏：三大角色矩阵、活动形式、近期日程与预约加入 */}
      <main class='survey-main'>
        {/* 1. 角色协同矩阵 */}
        <section class='content-block' id='roles'>
          <div class='section-header'>
            <div class='header-title-row'>
              <div>
                <span class='section-eyebrow'>THE TRIAD MATRIX</span>
                <h2 class='section-heading'>三大角色 · 协同闭环</h2>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class='section-desc'>
              告别单打独斗的瓶颈。一个好的独立作品或商业方案，需要完整的三角支点：
            </p>

            {/* 角色交互筛选器 (Segmented Filter Control) */}
            <div class='triad-filter-bar' role='tablist' aria-label='角色视角切换'>
              <button type='button' class='filter-tab is-active' data-filter='all'>
                全部支点 · All (3)
              </button>
              <button type='button' class='filter-tab' data-filter='pm'>
                PM · 产品定义
              </button>
              <button type='button' class='filter-tab' data-filter='ixd'>
                IxD · 交互触感
              </button>
              <button type='button' class='filter-tab' data-filter='fe'>
                FE · 工程落地
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='role-cards-grid' id='role-cards-container'>
            {/* PM 卡片 */}
            <div class='role-card card-pm' data-role='pm'>
              <div class='role-card-header'>
                <span class='role-index'>01</span>
                <div class='role-badge badge-pm'>PM · 产品经理</div>
              </div>
              <h3 class='role-title'>从混沌中定义秩序</h3>
              <p class='role-detail'>
                真实痛点挖掘、0-1 MVP 架构、核心业务闭环裁决、精益验证与需求取舍。
              </p>
              <div class='role-synergy'>
                <span class='synergy-tag'>在协同中提供</span>
                <p>清晰的商业与逻辑骨架，确保每一行代码与每一套设计都有明确的用户价值。</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* IxD 卡片 */}
            <div class='role-card card-ixd' data-role='ixd'>
              <div class='role-card-header'>
                <span class='role-index'>02</span>
                <div class='role-badge badge-ixd'>IxD · 交互体验</div>
              </div>
              <h3 class='role-title'>赋予逻辑以触感与呼吸</h3>
              <p class='role-detail'>
                视觉传达系统、Design Tokens、信息层级编排、微交互动效与无障碍心智。
              </p>
              <div class='role-synergy'>
                <span class='synergy-tag'>在协同中提供</span>
                <p>克制而高级的视觉质感与平滑交互，让冰冷的功能变成让人流连的艺术品。</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* FE 卡片 */}
            <div class='role-card card-fe' data-role='fe'>
              <div class='role-card-header'>
                <span class='role-index'>03</span>
                <div class='role-badge badge-fe'>FE · 前端架构</div>
              </div>
              <h3 class='role-title'>把图纸精准编译进现实</h3>
              <p class='role-detail'>
                现代 Web 框架 (Astro/React)、组件化工程、跨端响应式、高可用性能与出海部署。
              </p>
              <div class='role-synergy'>
                <span class='synergy-tag'>在协同中提供</span>
                <p>严密而健壮的代码实现，让灵感与设计百分百在浏览器中鲜活运行。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 2. 定期活动与互助机制 */}
        <section class='content-block' id='events'>
          <div class='section-header'>
            <span class='section-eyebrow'>COMMUNITY RHYTHM</span>
            <h2 class='section-heading'>我们的日常活动 · What We Do</h2>
            <p class='section-desc'>
              不设考核，不搞虚妄的社交攀比。只有热气腾腾的咖啡、真诚的交流与具体的作品：
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class='events-stack'>
            {/* 活动 1: Coffee Chat */}
            <div class='event-item'>
              <div class='event-icon-badge'>
                <svg width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5'>
                  <path d='M18 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1M2 8h16v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8zM6 1v3M10 1v3M14 1v3' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class='event-text'>
                <div class='event-title-line'>
                  <h3 class='event-name'>Offline & Online Coffee Chat</h3>
                  <span class='event-tag'>双周轻聚 · 低压真诚</span>
                </div>
                <p class='event-description'>
                  在杭州的静谧小馆或线上视频室，喝一杯好咖啡。聊聊各自在职场里的真实卡壳、最近着迷的技术与设计工具、或者正在构思的 side project。去爹味，不评判，纯粹倾听与共鸣。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* 活动 2: English Chat */}
            <div class='event-item'>
              <div class='event-icon-badge'>
                <svg width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5'>
                  <path d='M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class='event-text'>
                <div class='event-title-line'>
                  <h3 class='event-name'>English Tech & Design Chat</h3>
                  <span class='event-tag'>跨文化表达 · 国际视野</span>
                </div>
                <p class='event-description'>
                  定期用英语探讨产品与设计案例。包含 15 分钟的轻量 Show & Tell，在温暖、包容的环境里练习用英文讲清自己的设计决策与工程方案，消除出海与外企沟通焦虑。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* 活动 3: 作品搭建共建方案 */}
            <div class='event-item' id='portfolio'>
              <div class='event-icon-badge'>
                <svg width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.5'>
                  <path d='M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class='event-text'>
                <div class='event-title-line'>
                  <h3 class='event-name'>Portfolio & Side-Project Co-Building</h3>
                  <span class='event-tag'>经验互借 · 代表作搭建</span>
                </div>
                <p class='event-description'>
                  借助彼此的专业经验，不再做孤立的练习稿。PM 提供真实业务背景，IxD 打造顶奢低压视觉，FE 负责工程落地与部署，合力做出可直接展示在个人履历与 GitHub 上的代表作。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 3. 近期活动日程 */}
        <section class='content-block'>
          <div class='section-header'>
            <span class='section-eyebrow'>UPCOMING GATHERINGS</span>
            <h2 class='section-heading'>近期活动安排</h2>
          </div>

          <div class='schedule-cards'>
            <div class='schedule-card'>
              <div class='schedule-date'>
                <span class='date-number'>01</span>
                <span class='date-label'>Coffee Chat</span>
              </div>
              <div class='schedule-body'>
                <h4 class='schedule-title'>AI 时代的个人代表作策略与独立工具构想</h4>
                <p class='schedule-meta'>形式：杭州线下静谧小店 + 同步线上接入 | 适合：PM / 设计师 / 工程师</p>
                <p class='schedule-note'>交流重点：如何利用 AI 工具链，以最小阻力搭建具有个人辨识度的 Web 方案。</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class='schedule-card'>
              <div class='schedule-date'>
                <span class='date-number'>02</span>
                <span class='date-label'>English Chat</span>
              </div>
              <div class='schedule-body'>
                <h4 class='schedule-title'>Show & Tell: Walk Through Your Product or Figma in English</h4>
                <p class='schedule-meta'>形式：线上 Meet / Zoom (40-60 mins) | 适合：希望练习国际化表达的伙伴</p>
                <p class='schedule-note'>每人 5-10 分钟轻量展示一个自己喜欢的界面、组件或逻辑，互换反馈与鼓励。</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* 4. 加入我们 / 预约交流 (RSVP Form) */}
        <section class='content-block' id='join'>
          <div class='section-header'>
            <span class='section-eyebrow'>JOIN THE CIRCLE</span>
            <h2 class='section-heading'>预约交流 · 加入“我们”</h2>
            <p class='section-desc'>
              如果你也是身处技术、产品或设计领域的女性，正在寻找同频、真诚且能互相托举的伙伴，欢迎随时留下你的声音：
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class='form-wrapper'>
            <form id='join-form' class='quiet-form'>
              <div class='form-group'>
                <label for='name'>怎么称呼你 (Name / Nickname)</label>
                <input type='text' id='name' name='name' placeholder='例如：Erin / Alex' required autocomplete='off' />
              </div>

              {/* 核心角色交互筛选/选择器 */}
              <div class='form-group'>
                <label for='role'>你的核心专长 (Your Craft · 支持快捷点击)</label>
                
                {/* 快捷点击胶囊选择组 */}
                <div class='role-pill-group' id='role-pills' role='group' aria-label='选择你的核心专长'>
                  <button type='button' class='role-pill is-active' data-role-val='pm'>
                    <span class='role-dot'></span>
                    <span>PM · 产品经理</span>
                  </button>
                  <button type='button' class='role-pill' data-role-val='ixd'>
                    <span class='role-dot'></span>
                    <span>IxD · 交互设计</span>
                  </button>
                  <button type='button' class='role-pill' data-role-val='fe'>
                    <span class='role-dot'></span>
                    <span>FE · 前端架构</span>
                  </button>
                  <button type='button' class='role-pill' data-role-val='cross'>
                    <span class='role-dot'></span>
                    <span>全栈 / 独立创作者</span>
                  </button>
                </div>

                {/* 优化的下拉选择框（同步值，提供无障碍支持与移动端回退） */}
                <div class='select-container'>
                  <select id='role' name='role' required>
                    <option value='pm' selected>产品经理 (Product Manager)</option>
                    <option value='ixd'>交互 / UI / UX 设计师 (Interaction Designer)</option>
                    <option value='fe'>前端开发工程师 (Frontend Engineer)</option>
                    <option value='cross'>全栈 / 独立创作者 (Cross-disciplinary / Indie)</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>

              {/* 多选感兴趣的活动胶囊 */}
              <div class='form-group'>
                <label>感兴趣的活动与合作 (Select All That Apply)</label>
                <div class='quiet-pill-group'>
                  <label class='quiet-pill'>
                    <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='coffee_chat' checked />
                    <span class='quiet-pill-indicator'></span>
                    <span>☕ 线下 / 线上 Coffee Chat</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class='quiet-pill'>
                    <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='english_chat' checked />
                    <span class='quiet-pill-indicator'></span>
                    <span>🗣️ English Tech & Design Chat</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class='quiet-pill'>
                    <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='portfolio_building' checked />
                    <span class='quiet-pill-indicator'></span>
                    <span>🛠️ 个人作品方案共建 (Portfolio Co-building)</span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class='form-group'>
                <label for='idea'>你当前正在琢磨的想法、想搭建的项目或想交流的话题 (Optional)</label>
                <textarea
                  id='idea'
                  name='idea'
                  rows='3'
                  placeholder='例如：正在构思一个低压工具，想找设计师伙伴打磨界面；或者想练习用英语做一次产品 demo...'
                ></textarea>
              </div>

              <div class='form-group'>
                <label for='contact'>联系方式 (WeChat / Email)</label>
                <input
                  type='text'
                  id='contact'
                  name='contact'
                  placeholder='微信号或邮箱，仅用于活动组织与交流确认'
                  required
                  autocomplete='off'
                />
              </div>

              <button type='submit' class='btn btn-primary submit-btn'>
                <span>发送预约与交流意向</span>
                <span class='btn-arrow'>→</span>
              </button>

              <div id='form-feedback' class='form-feedback' style='display: none;'>
                <div class='feedback-card'>
                  <div class='feedback-icon-box'>✦</div>
                  <div class='feedback-text'>
                    <h4>已收到你的预约信息！</h4>
                    <p>感谢你的真诚加入。我们会尽快通过微信或邮件与你确认最近一期 Coffee Chat 的安排与时间。</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  // 1. 角色协同筛选器交互 (Triad Matrix Filter)
  const filterTabs = document.querySelectorAll('.filter-tab');
  const roleCards = document.querySelectorAll('.role-card');

  filterTabs.forEach((tab) => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      filterTabs.forEach((t) => t.classList.remove('is-active'));
      tab.classList.add('is-active');

      const filterVal = tab.getAttribute('data-filter');

      roleCards.forEach((card) => {
        const cardRole = card.getAttribute('data-role');
        if (filterVal === 'all' || cardRole === filterVal) {
          card.classList.remove('is-dimmed');
          card.classList.add('is-highlighted');
        } else {
          card.classList.add('is-dimmed');
          card.classList.remove('is-highlighted');
        }
      });
    });
  });

  // 2. 表单核心角色胶囊选择联动 (Role Pill Selector)
  const roleSelect = document.getElementById('role') as HTMLSelectElement | null;
  const rolePills = document.querySelectorAll('.role-pill');

  rolePills.forEach((pill) => {
    pill.addEventListener('click', () => {
      rolePills.forEach((p) => p.classList.remove('is-active'));
      pill.classList.add('is-active');

      const val = pill.getAttribute('data-role-val');
      if (roleSelect && val) {
        roleSelect.value = val;
      }
    });
  });

  if (roleSelect) {
    roleSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
      const currentVal = roleSelect.value;
      rolePills.forEach((pill) => {
        if (pill.getAttribute('data-role-val') === currentVal) {
          pill.classList.add('is-active');
        } else {
          pill.classList.remove('is-active');
        }
      });
    });
  }

  // 3. 表单提交响应
  const form = document.getElementById('join-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const feedback = document.getElementById('form-feedback');

  if (form && feedback) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const formData = new FormData(form);
      const data = Object.fromEntries(formData.entries());
      console.log('wo/men in tech registration:', data);

      feedback.style.display = 'block';
      const submitBtn = form.querySelector('.submit-btn') as HTMLElement | null;
      if (submitBtn) {
        submitBtn.style.display = 'none';
      }

      feedback.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .survey-home {
    padding: var(--spacing-8) 0 var(--spacing-24);
  }

  /* ----- 左右两栏布局 ----- */
  .two-column-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2.1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-16);
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* ----- 左侧栏 (Sidebar) ----- */
  .sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    top: var(--spacing-8);
    padding-right: var(--spacing-8);
    border-right: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-divider);
  }

  .site-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    line-height: var(--line-height-tight);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    border-bottom: none !important;
  }

  .site-title .brand-slash {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0 0.04em;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.75;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .site-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-8);
    line-height: var(--line-height-snug);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .intro-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .intro-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  }

  .intro-zh,
  .intro-en {
    font-family: var(--font-family-text);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .intro-zh p,
  .intro-en p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .intro-zh strong,
  .intro-en strong {
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  }

  .manifesto-lead {
